        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Agatha Christie’s A.B.C Murders tells the story of Captain Hastings and Hercule Poirot as they attempt to solve a series of bizarre murders committed by an elusive madman. Going off the simple clue of the A.B.C railway guide left at the scene of each crime, Hastings and Poirot follow the leads to Andover, Bexhill, Churston, and Doncaster trying to apprehend the killer before the next crime is committed.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Agatha Christie's A.B.C Murders narra la historia del capitán Hastings y Hercule Poirot, que intentan resolver una serie de extraños asesinatos cometidos por un demente escurridizo. Partiendo de la sencilla pista de la guía ferroviaria A.B.C. dejada en la escena de cada crimen, Hastings y Poirot siguen las pistas hasta Andover, Bexhill, Churston y Doncaster, tratando de atrapar al asesino antes de que se cometa el siguiente crimen.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2009",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
