          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Agatha Christie's world famous novel, And Then There Were None, is brought to the PC with all of its original baffling suspense!\n\nTen people, strangers to each other, are invited to a lavish estate on an island. Through a recording, their mysterious host accuses each of his 'guests' of murder and proceeds to exact 'justice.' The tension mounts as, one-by-one, the number of people are reduced through the ingenious plotting of the unseen killer. Prepare to play the video game based on the Bestselling Murder Mystery of All-Time!",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "La novela mundialmente famosa de Agatha Christie, And Then There Were None, llega a PC con todo su suspense desconcertante original.\n\nDiez personas, extrañas entre sí, son invitadas a una lujosa finca en una isla. Mediante una grabación, su misterioso anfitrión acusa a cada uno de sus «invitados» de asesinato y procede a impartir «justicia». La tensión aumenta a medida que, uno a uno, el número de personas se reduce gracias a la ingeniosa trama del asesino invisible. ¡Prepárate para jugar al videojuego basado en la novela de misterio y asesinatos más vendida de todos los tiempos!",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2005",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
