        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Death on the Nile is an adventure-detective game, offering a fresh twist on Agatha Christie’s famous story. Set in the lively 1970s, play as Hercule Poirot and detective Jane Royce as they solve two connected mysteries. Dive into a journey filled with intrigue, deception, and unexpected revelations.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Death on the Nile es un juego de aventura y detectives que ofrece un giro novedoso a la famosa historia de Agatha Christie. Ambientado en los animados años setenta, juegas como Hercule Poirot y la detective Jane Royce mientras resuelven dos misterios conectados. Adéntrate en un viaje lleno de intriga, engaños y revelaciones inesperadas.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
